  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhance response to and mitigation of protection risks and response to child protection and SGBV nee</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Specific Objective 1: Strengthened and improved quality of SGBV services for asylum seekers, refugees, and host communities in Khartoum state._x000d_
_x000d_
Output 1.1: SGBV survivors (aged 0-17 and 18-24) receive quality, timely and age sensitive support services._x000d_
Output 1.2 Community mechanisms strengthened for self-management _x000d_
_x000d_
Specific objective 2: Strengthened protective environment and lifesaving assistance for girls and boys from asylum seeker, refugees, and host communities in Khartoum state. _x000d_
_x000d_
Output 2.1:  Age and gender sensitive individual case management services are provided to girls and boys at risk_x000d_
Output 2.2   The most at-risk girls and boys and adolescents, including UASC, receive psychosocial support and services _x000d_
Output 2.3 Community-based child protection committees are strengthened</narrative>
  </description>
